# The build context is ./assistant. The dev container writes
# app/node_modules through its bind mount; copying that tree
# into the production image would let a hand-patched or
# compromised dependency ride past the lockfile (npm keeps a
# package it finds at the locked version without re-checking
# its hash — KNF-152). Tests and the eval harness never run
# in production.
app/node_modules
app/tests
app/eval
**/.DS_Store
